ar on Trattoria Bella (Reviews (1), no QA text).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied WEEKEND20 -> toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 20% off weekend dining\\\" + badge \\\"WEEKEND20 - 20% off\\\"; X button removed it and restored the input; applied WELCOME10 (10% off) and after submit the reservation card shows \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\" (stored couponCode WELCOME10).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Calendar (Aug 2026, today=Aug 28) marks all cells 1-28 [disabled]; Aug 29 onward selectable. Picked Sep 1, 2026 and time dropdown offered restaurant's availableTimes 17:00-21:00; selected 19:00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be modified\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" controls (dialog text: \\\"Modify Reservation / New Time 19:00 / Party Size 2 Guests / Save Changes / Close\\\") — no date field at all. Time 19:00->20:30 and party 2->5 saved and displayed correctly, but the date (September 1, 2026) is unchangeable.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reviews are not gated by a completed reservation\", \"actual\": \"On Trattoria Bella (restaurant 3), where the user has no reservation of any kind, the \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab was fully enabled and a 5-star review was accepted: toast \\\"Review Submitted!\\\", tab changed to Reviews (2), and the review persisted (stored under restaurantId 3). The earlier Sakura Garden review was also accepted against only an upcoming (not completed) reservation, and no reservation-to-review linkage exists, so the one-review-per-completed-reservation limit is not enforced either.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon eligibility rules (weekend-day and first-reservation) are not enforced\", \"actual\": \"WEEKEND20 (\\\"20% off weekend dining\\\") was accepted for a Tuesday reservation (Sep 1, 2026) -> toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 20% off weekend dining\\\". WELCOME10 (\\\"10% off your first reservation\\\") was accepted on a second booking made after an existing confirmed reservation already existed -> toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 10% off your first reservation\\\". Only the party-size rule works (GROUP15 with 2 guests rejected: \\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more\\\"; accepted at 6 guests). One-coupon-max is enforced (input replaced by badge + remove button once applied).\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting with name/email/phone filled but no date/time -> toast \\\"Missing Information: Please fill in all required fields.\\\" and no reservation stored. Name/email/phone inputs are required with type=email; invalid email \\\"not-an-email\\\" blocks submit (checkValidity()=false, message \\\"Please include an '@' ...\\\") and no reservation was created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify opens a \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog whose supported options (New Time, Party Size) saved successfully (19:00->20:30, 2->5 Guests, toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\"). Cancel opens alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" with Keep Reservation / Cancel Reservation; choosing \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" left the reservation intact (still Upcoming (2), status confirmed), only the explicit confirm removed it.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create: toast \\\"Reservation Confirmed! Your table at The Golden Fork is booked for September 1, 2026 at 19:00.\\\" + inline confirmation panel; the reservation appeared in Upcoming immediately via in-app navigation. Modify: toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\" and card instantly showed 20:30 / 5 Guests. Cancel: toast \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\" and tab counts updated live Upcoming (2)->(1), Past (0)->(1). No page reload was performed at any point.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Separate tabs \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" / \\\"Past (1)\\\". Upcoming card: Sakura Garden, Japanese · $$$, \\\"Upcoming\\\" badge, September 5 2026, 19:00, 6 Guests, Arts District, \\\"Coupon applied: GROUP15\\\". Past card: The Golden Fork, \\\"Cancelled\\\" badge, September 1 2026, 20:30, 5 Guests, Downtown, \\\"Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating/review-count inconsistent between list and detail; list rating not derived from reviews and never updates\", \"actual\": \"The Golden Fork: list card shows 4.8 (no review count) while its detail page shows 4.5 (2). Sakura Garden: list shows 4.6, detail showed 5.0 (1); after submitting a 4-star review the detail updated to 4.5 (2) and tab \\\"Reviews (2)\\\", but the list card still shows 4.6 — unchanged and inconsistent.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
